.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
.TH OCTA-METERS 1 "" "OCTA-CAPTURE @PROJECT_VERSION@" "OCTA-CAPTURE Manual"
.SH NAME
octa\-meters \- observe the eight SysEx input meters
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBocta-meters\fR [DURATION-MS [CTRL-PORT]]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enable input-meter notifications, print input_levels and input_db as JSON lines,
then disable notifications on ordinary exit or handled SIGINT/SIGTERM.
DURATION-MS is 1..60000, default 5000.
This observes the device's input meters and does not open an audio PCM stream.
.PP
The default CTRL MIDI port is hw:CARD=OCTACAPTURE,DEV=0,SUBDEV=1. Close other control-panel/CTRL clients before opening it. Audio streaming is independent of this connection.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero indicates success; nonzero indicates a usage, device or operation error.
.SH SEE ALSO
octa-capture(1), octa-status(1), octa-preset(1)
